# List churn for the GC hole check (eu-oaz72.51): run under
# EU_GC_POISON=1 at a small --heap-limit-mib so that the heap collects
# hundreds of times and recycled blocks are reused hole by hole.

xs(n): range(0, n) map(_ * 3) filter(_ > 10) reverse
f(i): xs(300 + i) sum
result: range(0, 100) map(f) sum
